          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "محيط (muḥīṭ) is built on the native Arabic root ḥ-w-ṭ, \"to surround\" (Lane). It is the Form IV participle: the sea that surrounds the land."
            }
          ]
